{"id":"shape_dtw","title":"DTW on local shape descriptors","family":"elastic","definition":"reference","intro_en":"shapeDTW compares short neighborhoods around samples so that a match reflects local context. Here each descriptor contains three raw values with edge repetition, and DTW minimizes squared descriptor differences. The animation reports the descriptor-space objective, an explicit variant rather than a raw-signal score recomputed along its path.","intro_zh":"shapeDTW 用观测周围的短邻域描述局部形状。本例将三个原始数值组成描述符，边界使用重复填充，然后最小化描述符之间的平方差。动图报告描述符空间的目标值，不是沿该路径重新计算的原始信号距离。","steps_en":["Construct a three-sample raw neighborhood descriptor at each index, repeating edge values.","Compute local squared discrepancies; apply the indicated weights or admissibility mask.","At each admissible cell, add its local cost to the smallest predecessor cost.","Trace one minimizing path and take the square root of its accumulated objective."],"steps_zh":["逐点构造三个采样值的原始邻域描述符，在边界重复端点数值。","计算局部平方误差，并施加指定权重或允许匹配的掩码。","在每个允许单元格，把局部代价加到三个前驱的最小累计代价上。","回溯一条最小化目标的路径，并对其累计目标值取平方根。"],"formula":"phi(x_i)=[x_(i-1),x_i,x_(i+1)] with edge repetition; d=DTW(phi(x),phi(y))","caveats_en":["Descriptor radius, scaling and the choice to rescore the final path in raw space all change the method. No trained descriptor is used here.","Signal scale, path constraints and final normalization must match before distances from different tools are compared."],"caveats_zh":["邻域半径、缩放以及是否在原空间重新计分都会改变结果；本例没有训练描述符。","比较不同工具的数值之前，须统一信号尺度、路径约束和最终归一化。"],"sources":[{"label":"Zhao and Itti: shapeDTW","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1606.01601"},{"label":"EchoTime imported atlas: named formula conventions","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/data/ts_similarity_package_v2_registry.csv"}],"x":[0.2,0.4,1.1,2.4,3.2,2.5,1.2,0.3,-0.4,-0.1],"y":[0.1,0.3,0.5,1.2,2.6,3.1,2.3,1.1,0.2,-0.3],"input_label":"Deterministic illustrative arrays; no benchmark data","parameters":{"local_cost":"squared Euclidean","final_square_root":true,"normalization":"none","descriptor":true,"descriptor_radius":1,"padding":"edge repetition","reported_cost":"descriptor-space"},"result":{"label":"distance","value":0.9746794344808966,"detail":"The explicit definition and parameters shown on this card."},"frames":[{"phase":0,"caption":"Three-point neighborhoods describe context around each sample","panel":{"kind":"bars","title":"Descriptors at x[1] and y[2]","a":[0.2,0.2,0.4],"b":[0.1,0.3,0.5],"labels":["previous","center","next"],"a_label":"x neighborhood","b_label":"y neighborhood"}},{"phase":0,"caption":"Three-point neighborhoods describe context around each sample","panel":{"kind":"bars","title":"Descriptors at x[4] and y[5]","a":[1.1,2.4,3.2],"b":[1.2,2.6,3.1],"labels":["previous","center","next"],"a_label":"x neighborhood","b_label":"y neighborhood"}},{"phase":0,"caption":"Three-point neighborhoods describe context around each sample","panel":{"kind":"bars","title":"Descriptors at x[7] and y[8]","a":[2.5,1.2,0.3],"b":[2.3,1.1,0.2],"labels":["previous","center","next"],"a_label":"x neighborhood","b_label":"y neighborhood"}},{"phase":0,"caption":"Three-point neighborhoods describe context around each sample","panel":{"kind":"bars","title":"Descriptors at x[10] and y[10]","a":[-0.4,-0.1,-0.1],"b":[0.2,-0.3,-0.3],"labels":["previous","center","next"],"a_label":"x neighborhood","b_label":"y neighborhood"}},{"phase":1,"caption":"Extend solved prefixes using the stated recurrence","panel":{"kind":"matrix","title":"Accumulated prefix costs","z":[[0.030000000000000013,0.060000000000000005,0.7999999999999999,6.73,20.78,38.56,51.870000000000005,57.13,58.43,59.17],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,nu